graph TD
    Plan[Plan + relevant_space_ids] --> TableNode[sql_synthesis_table_node]
    TableNode --> Loop{loop_reason?}
    Loop -->|retry| Retry[Inject retry feedback<br/>only regenerate failed SQL]
    Loop -->|sequential_next| Sequential[Inject sequential context<br/>generate one next query]
    Loop -->|none| Direct[Use plan as-is]

    Retry --> Agent[SQL Synthesis Table Agent]
    Sequential --> Agent
    Direct --> Agent

    Agent --> Tools[UC function toolkit]
    Tools --> Summary[get_space_summary]
    Tools --> Overview[get_table_overview]
    Tools --> Column[get_column_detail]
    Tools --> Instructions[get_space_instructions]
    Tools --> Details[get_space_details<br/>last resort]
    Summary --> Metadata[Table metadata and instructions]
    Overview --> Metadata
    Column --> Metadata
    Instructions --> Metadata
    Details --> Metadata

    Metadata --> Draft[Draft SQL + explanation]
    Draft --> Extract[Extract SQL blocks<br/>and query labels]
    Extract --> More{Result type}
    More -->|NO_MORE_QUERIES| Done[Use preserved results<br/>summarize]
    More -->|SQL found| Exec[Set next_agent<br/>sql_execution]
    More -->|no SQL or error| SummaryNext[Set synthesis_error<br/>summarize]

    classDef agentClass fill:#4A90E2,stroke:#2E5C8A,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
    classDef dataClass fill:#50C878,stroke:#2E7D4E,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff
    classDef processClass fill:#F5A623,stroke:#C17D11,stroke-width:2px,color:#000
    classDef decisionClass fill:#8E44AD,stroke:#6C3483,stroke-width:2px,color:#fff

    class TableNode,Agent agentClass
    class Plan,Metadata,Exec,Done,SummaryNext dataClass
    class Retry,Sequential,Direct,Tools,Summary,Overview,Column,Instructions,Details,Draft,Extract processClass
    class Loop,More decisionClass
